# Line endings are LF in the repository and LF in every working tree.
#
# This is not cosmetic here. Warrant's hunk engine treats a line's terminator
# as part of the line, so that a reconstruction is byte-exact — and a checkout
# that rewrote CRLF into LF would make the tool disagree with the repository
# about what the agent actually wrote.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.wasm binary
